      "Accepts a human-readable, localized string that indicates the number of results. For example, \"1 match\" or \"165 matches.\" If the total number of results is unknown, also include an indication that there may be more results than the number listed. For example, \"25+ matches.\" The count text is only displayed when `filteringText` isn't empty. When the `countText` or `filteringText` changes, it will be announced to assistive technologies.",
